### Dashboard API Testing

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000/api
@authToken = Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Dashboard Summary with date filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary?fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&period=month&topProductsLimit=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Revenue Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/revenue?fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&period=month
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Customer Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/customers?period=month
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Inventory Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/inventory
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Order Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/orders?fromDate=2024-01-01&toDate=2024-12-31&period=week
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Top Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/top-products?limit=5&period=month
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get Sales by Product Types
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/sales-by-product-types?period=month
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Get KPIs (Key Performance Indicators)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/kpis?period=month
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Test without authentication (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary

### Test with various parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/top-products?limit=3&branchId=1&productTypeIds=1,2,3
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Test inventory with low stock threshold
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/inventory?lowStockThreshold=5&lowStockProductsLimit=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
